---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — Reeltotranscript"
  description="Terms of service and usage guidelines for using Reeltotranscript free browser tools."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0066cc] dark:text-[#2997ff] mb-2">Terms & Conditions</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-neutral-500">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-sm text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-[#1c1c1e] border border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-neutral-800 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using Reeltotranscript (https://reeltotranscript.com), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you should discontinue use of the website immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-[#1c1c1e] border border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-neutral-800 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">2. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p>
          Reeltotranscript is intended for legal and fair-use transcription of short-form media for research, education, commentary, accessibility, and content creation. You agree not to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>Transcribe copyrighted content where you lack legal rights, license, or fair use authorization.</li>
          <li>Use the service to process harmful, defamatory, or unlawful material.</li>
          <li>Attempt to disrupt, overload, or reverse-engineer our web infrastructure.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-[#1c1c1e] border border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-neutral-800 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">3. Third-Party Trademarks & Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, and Meta are registered trademarks of their respective owners. Reeltotranscript is an independent productivity web tool and is not endorsed, sponsored, affiliated with, or associated in any way with Meta Platforms Inc., ByteDance, or Google LLC.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-[#1c1c1e] border border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-neutral-800 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">4. Disclaimer of Warranty</h2>
        <p>
          The service is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. Reeltotranscript does not warrant that AI model speech transcriptions will be 100% error-free or uninterrupted.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-[#1c1c1e] border border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-neutral-800 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">5. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms may be directed to <a href="mailto:hello@reeltotranscript.com" class="text-[#0066cc] dark:text-[#2997ff] hover:underline font-medium">hello@reeltotranscript.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
